      "failure": "Node.text(omit_permalink=True) suppresses the anchor node but retains its preceding sibling space. All 39 manifest H1 values end without that separator. The first otherwise-valid reader therefore fails the exact H1 comparison. The scaffold concatenates heading and anchor without the installed separator, masking the mismatch.",
      "required_change": "Bind the exact installed permalink separator representation in expectations or validate and remove only that source-defined separator when extracting the heading. Preserve exact heading-content comparison and the Appendix F inline-code distinction. Make the synthetic positive fixture include the real separator, with negative controls for changed heading content and an extra separator. Do not broadly strip heading whitespace.",
      "new_control": {
        "reason": "Existing scaffold omits a source-proven renderer separator; one bounded synthetic control was needed to demonstrate the mismatch. Existing 33 controls were not rerun.",
